ense PK battles up close on the big virtual screen for a comprehensively upgraded interactive experience.", "short_description": "Douyin VR Live is a next-generation VR user-facing streaming platform that is committed to bringing you an exhilarating and immersive interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "logozh.png", "id": "1439261319980082", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75441583_1439261323313415_6105103478412624436_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jjE_tLzHioQQ7kNvwHKhr8J&_nc_oc=AdmEL_apb1S4a6P5NkjjN5viM6Kh5X-kJzJbrPc4RFVrAR8vBoqYqhy2PI3kHYlcESI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvD-KlSrS-iNV8cDvNTqT3-Erff5SuTz-zaTBIx8u9t6w&oe=699ED1DC"}, {"file_name": "2560 x 1440.png", "id": "1222877525073722", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982446_1222877528407055_8056433039736167714_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aveWPnEPJQAQ7kNvwFkqQQ1&_nc_oc=AdmxsrWPJRwOlJJ4o4oYJCi_MGf-AvCBaRlu4A94E9uq28XoqsjU8iJKxa612ORVNEg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsT19iCdZ41Q0gGj_a1lTLYI5-_6-yW0nm-y11md_e8EA&oe=699F051C"}, {"file_name": "1440 x 1440.png", "id": "961925418233844", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036617_961925421567177_3841510894552774559_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2heJo8AddvgQ7kNvwHmZHZO&_nc_oc=AdnkmHzTXq7q1Y9L_EFjwOF2unvpTJ-WJNo_qhw_7YbzGitDS_yU-xduz43V92DRm0g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsGBEWh5TCry6f2BnnSSECXiyXwNNpb2loTw3HG8VLmPQ&oe=699EDCC5"}, {"file_name": "1080X360.png", "id": "715848710371996", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974523_715848713705329_284747130245148719_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=M-p-qqExzdoQ7kNvwGlQ6ZT&_nc_oc=AdmfKZT6Pq9q